These MIDI files (<id>.mid, <id>_chord.mid, <id>_0500.mid, <id>_1000.mid) are
not the original files from piano-midi.de. They are derivative MIDI files
regenerated from note pitch/duration and pedal data extracted from MIDI files
by Bernd Krueger, published at http://www.piano-midi.de.

Per http://piano-midi.de/copy.htm, the original MIDI files are licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Germany License (CC BY-SA 3.0
DE), and adaptations (such as these regenerated files) inherit the same
license:

    http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/de/deed.en

You may use and adapt these files as long as you:

  - attribute the copyright holder of the original MIDI files
      Name:   Bernd Krueger
      Source: http://www.piano-midi.de

  - distribute or publicly perform it (or any adaptation) only under the
    same (CC BY-SA 3.0 DE) license.
